WEBVTT

00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:14,720
Took Fendizal today for the first time. I felt a little off for a few hours, slightly

00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:21,920
queasy and just strange. Is this normal? Just eat, it's best to just eat something fatty

00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:30,240
with it or right after it. That will go away. I mean, I have not, I've had the only time I've

00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:38,480
had people say that Fendizal hurt my tummy is when they first start taking it and then it will go

00:00:38,720 --> 00:00:43,920
goes away. Eat some food with it, eat a fatty meal with it. That's what's best you're going to absorb

00:00:43,920 --> 00:00:49,920
it better. It's going to, you're not going to have any, you're going to have less gut problems

00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:57,520
with it. And quite honestly, having gut problems are feeling queasy with Fendizal is not a symptom

00:00:57,520 --> 00:01:03,360
that anybody ever complains of except when they first start taking it because typically

00:01:03,360 --> 00:01:10,240
they're a little nervous. And so it may be coming from that. The biggest thing that you

00:01:10,240 --> 00:01:16,640
want to look at with Fendizal, even more so than I've ever been, is you want to keep an eye on

00:01:16,640 --> 00:01:26,480
your liver markers because it can affect the drug. So it can affect your AST, ALT and alcohol

00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:32,160
and phosphatase if you don't want that to go through the roof. So we just kind of keep an eye on

00:01:32,160 --> 00:01:39,760
that and if your numbers are already high, we just don't want to elevate anymore.

